%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNo, there's no mistake; the real estate department of our\ncompany is responsible for supplying Mitsumaru Real Estate\nwith fraudulent accounts.\d%K%P
「不，我没有弄错。\n我们公司的房地产部，参与了三丸房地产的账目伪造」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dK-Keep your voice down, dammit!\d%K%P
「喂、喂，给我住口！」%K%P
It was a minor detail that eventually led me to this.%K%P
没错，契机来源于细枝末节。%K%P
Michihama's old accounts -- the ones I started\ninvestigating for my training period.%K%P
在实习期间，我无意间开始对道浜商事决算情况的调查。%K%P
Our sales would be consistent for an entire month, and had\nto have brought in a lot of profit, but when I'd check the\naccounting records, we were supposedly barely out of the\nred.%K%P
每个月的销售额如此稳定，\n照理说利益应该会不断累计上升才对，\n但是每当来到决算期，这个部门就算不是亏本，盈利也少得可怜。%K%P
And it remained stable for years -- no rise or fall, even\nin the face of the unstable economic situation of our\ncountry; the profits remained roughly the same despite\nsales being all over the place.%K%P
而且没有波动。\n和国内经济的沉浮无关，每年持续着同样的状况。\n销售额和之前一年相比也明显存在着差数。%K%P
At first I suspected tax evasion, but there was an even\nmore surprising truth concealed behind all those layers of\nfalsified documents.%K%P
一开始，我还在想这是不是公司靠申报较低的金额来逃税，\n但答案却隐藏在了意外的地方。%K%P
This company was using the profit of other departments to\ncover up the huge annual losses of our real estate branch.%K%P
这家公司，因为动用所有部门来掩盖房地产部的赤字，\n盈利额才锐减的。%K%P
And the main force that had dealings with that branch of\nours -- in fact, responsible for over 90 percent of our\nlosses -- was Mitsumaru Real Estate, a relatively huge\nreal estate company.%K%P
而房地产部的主要客户…\n占据了销售额名义下的赤字的９０％的，\n是三丸房地产这一中大型房地产公司。%K%P
It was nothing compared to the Sawashima Group, but some\nof their recent investments and projects might have become\na thorn in the side of that monster of a company.%K%P
虽然规模和泽嶋不动产比不了，\n但最近也参与了各式各样的竞标，\n对于泽嶋来说，它是有些麻烦的存在。%K%P
I was surprised that Ms. Sawashima knew the name of a mid-\ntier company like Michihama, but then it wouldn't have\nbeen that strange if it was at odds with her father.%K%P
虽然她知道这样的中小企业让人觉着不可思议，\n但毕竟是她父亲的竞争公司旗下的关联企业，\n这样就多少可以接受了。%K%P
And...%K%P
接下来…%K%P
