Mr. Miwa was responsible for most of what was going on at\nour accounting department right now, while Mr. Terakawa\nwas the managing director of our real estate department.%K%P
会计部的董事三轮专务，\n还有房地产部的董事寺川常务。%K%P
And Mitsumaru Real Estate seemed to have been always\ninvolved with assigning personnel to those posts.%K%P
这两个职位，不管过去还是现在，\n都是直接从三丸房地产那里调过来的。%K%P
Which made us practically a de-facto subsidiary of them.%K%P
三丸的人一直担当这种重要的职位，\n先不说登记上的问题，从内部来看这公司简直就像是三丸的子公司一样。%K%P
Yet on paper, our companies were barely involved. What a\nknavish... I mean, delicate design.%K%P
而且这连共同决算的对象都不算，\n实在是设置得十分狡猾…不不，微妙的位置呢。%K%P
