%LCChief
%LC科长
\dThen stop saying those outrageous things. Why don't you\ncut this out and spend your time in peace and quiet?\d%K%P
「所以说还是不要说这种冒失的话了吧…\n像现在这样在这里安稳地度过每一天如何」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI wish I could, I truly do. But I cannot any longer.\d%K%P
「要是我做得到的话也就这么做了啊。\n但是，现在也不能这么说了」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dYou are so young; you still haven't discarded your\nideals. I, too, was your age once, and...\d%K%P
「你啊，太年轻了。\n还是舍不下理想啊。\n我也是，在那个时期…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThat's not it. I suspect that Mitsumaru will be\ninvestigated in a few months.\d%K%P
「并不是这样…\n大概，在几个月之内，搜查之手就要伸向三丸了」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dWha...?!\d%K%P
「什…！？」%K%P
\d...come autumn...\d%K%P
『到了秋天的话…』%K%P
Indeed, we'd have no free time once autumn came.%K%P
没错，到了秋天的话，就不会有那么多空闲时间了。%K%P
And after that, we would probably have more free time than\nwe wished for.%K%P
而且弄不好那阵风波一过，\n说不定反而要赋闲了。%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dWh-Who told you that?\d%K%P
「这、这传言哪儿来的？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI... cannot say, but my source is very trustworthy.\d%K%P
「那我…不能说。\n但是，是非常可信的来源」%K%P
After all, it was most likely a relative of the one who\nwas planning it.%K%P
再怎么说，多半，是策划人的亲属。%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dImpossible... Not even the higher-ups have heard anything\nof the sort!\d%K%P
「这太荒唐了…\n这个消息，连上层领导都还不知道吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dBut the possibility is nonetheless very high. And I\nbelieve they have cornered us to the point where it hardly\neven matters whether we discover their plans or not.\d%K%P
「就算这样可能性也是很高的。\n而且我想，大概已经被抓住尾巴，\n就算咱们这边知道也没有问题了」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dWh... Wh ... Wha...\d%K%P
「什、什、什…」%K%P
If that wasn't the case, then no matter how naive and\noverly generous that lady was, she still would have kept\nher mouth shut.%K%P
要是没有那种程度的确凿证据，\n就算她有多善良，也不应该向我丢出这样的话。%K%P
As such, I could tell she was talking not about\npossibilities, but things that were already set in motion.%K%P
所以我明白了。\n那并不是可能不可能的问题，\n只是单纯的未来将要发生的事实。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe don't have time...\d%K%P
「已经没有时间了…」%K%P
In other words, if I did nothing, Michihama Commerce would\ninevitably be crushed by the Sawashima Group.%K%P
简单地说，就是道浜商事…\n如果就这样放之不管，就会被泽嶋不动产击溃。%K%P
And all Mitsumaru Real Estate would receive would be a\nslap on the wrist.%K%P
这同时只不过是击溃三丸房地产的开端。%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dNo... But then what can we do...?!\d%K%P
「这…要怎么办好呢」%K%P
Chief Hiragi covered his face with his palms as he let out\na deep sigh.%K%P
平木科长用他那老练的厚厚手掌捂住了脸，\n发出了深深的叹息。%K%P
He'd yet to notice that his body language had confirmed\neverything I said.%K%P
他的这个态度，其实是全身心肯定了我还只是推测的指摘，\n这一点他自己大概都没意识到吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dCooperate with me, and we might figure out something\ntogether.\d%K%P
「我们一起考虑吧。\n在此之后，应该怎么努力才好」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dFigure out...?\d%K%P
「考虑…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI need your influence -- someone who has been inside for\na long time. Please!\d%K%P
「一直在这公司工作的科长您的力量是必要的。\n拜托了！」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dYoshimura...\d%K%P
「芳村君…」%K%P
We had to figure something out.%K%P
没错，不考虑是不行的。%K%P
A lizard's tail, once cut off, ceased functioning before\nlong.%K%P
切掉的尾巴，放着不管的话很快就会停止活动。%K%P
So before that happened, we had to figure out a way for it\nsurvive on its own.%K%P
在变成那样之前，要想出只让尾巴存活的方法。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAi'ght, Ms. #2, toss it!\d%K%P
「好的，二号，球抛过来！」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dAh, h-here you go!\d%K%P
「啊、嗯、嗯…好！」%K%P
