%LC喜兵卫
\dHmph!\d%K%P
「看我的！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dNicely done, Mr. Retired! We're safe for now!\d%K%P
「漂亮，老爷子！\n好的，回来了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWe've got a chance ball!\d%K%P
「机会球机会球…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'm raising it!\d%K%P
「要上了哦」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dNice toss! Here you go!\d%K%P
「传得漂亮………来！」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dKyah?!\d%K%P
「呀！？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYay, it's 2-1.\d%K%P
「ｙｅａｈ～，局分２－１」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dVictory!\d%K%P
「赢了～」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dWell, that was quite immature of you, Hattsuan. Were you\nthat desperate to win?\d%K%P
「喂喂，你也太孩子气了吧，小八。\n你就这么想赢吗？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dA group of men and women on a midsummer beach... 'course\nI gotta show off.\d%K%P
「毕竟是炎夏海滩上男女四人…的比赛呢」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dKhahh, the axe goes to the wood from whence it borrowed\nits helve; the wisdom of our forefathers never lies. No\nmore games, Young Mistress. Let's roast them good in the\nnext bout!\d%K%P
「啊～，这就是所谓的恩将仇报么。\n小房东，不要再客气了，\n下一次打他们个落花流水」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dBefore that, can I get something to drink?\d%K%P
「在此之前，我渴啦～」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dLet's have a break at the seaside restaurant.\d%K%P
「那，在海之家休息一下吧～」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dOh, you guys are finally back! The chilled beer they have\nhere rocks!\d%K%P
「哦，来了吗。\n冻得叮叮作响的啤酒很棒呢～」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dOh, that sounds nice. Perhaps I shall have one too.\d%K%P
「哦，那个很棒哦。\n我是不是也要来一杯呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, I'll take a cola.\d%K%P
「我、我要可乐」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dI'd like melon-flavored shaved ice.\d%K%P
「我要蜜瓜冰」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOh, in that case maybe I should order green tea-flavored\nice cream instead.\d%K%P
「呃，夏夜小姐要喝冰吗？\n怎么办，我也要放弃可乐去喝宇治金时吗？」\n※译注：一种冰品的通称。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI'm hungry so I'll take beer and stir-fried soba. Also\nsome grilled corn.\d%K%P
「我肚子饿了，要啤酒和炒面。\n还有拜托给我烤玉米～」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAh, in that case I'll order another round of baked clams.\nHey, Mr. Waiter, you heard all that?\d%K%P
「那我也要追加大蛤仔。\n喂～店员先～生，我要点单~」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...You sure can keep this up for a long time.\d%K%P
「…大家还真玩得欢啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dAh, you! Keep your cold rain out of our sunny paradise!\d%K%P
「啊啊，喂！\n不要在太阳和海闪耀着光芒的这片蓝天下用冷水浇我啊～！」%K%P
Canned beer. Canned cola. And some shaved ice in a pack.%K%P
罐装啤酒、罐装可乐和杯装刨冰。%K%P
Stir-fried soba and fried corn-flavored snacks. Also, some\ninstant clam soup.%K%P
杯装炒面和烤玉米，\n还有即食蛤仔汁。%K%P
A voluptuous polygon girl in a swimsuit played beach\nvolleyball on the TV screen while no players pushed any\nbuttons.%K%P
电视画面上出现的，是穿着性感泳装的姐姐。\n背景画面也是沙滩排球的，以此来自娱自乐。%K%P
We were, of course, at the Terrace House Hinosaka, in my\nroom.%K%P
地点显然是在Terrace House阳之坂，我的房间…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHow come even Ms. Kaya and Mitoko are going along with\nyou this time?\d%K%P
「我说，为什么就连夏夜小姐和美都子都要跟着这么玩啊？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dW-Well...\d%K%P
「因、因为…」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou're too busy with your new job to take a trip to a\nreal beach, so Mr. Retired wanted to give you a simulated\ntaste of it, at least. And we thought we could help.\d%K%P
「理君最近这么忙没有办法去海边尽情玩耍，\n所以老爷子就庄重提议，\n至少把那种气氛给营造出来，呐？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dRight?\d%K%P
「呐？」%K%P
Those two were almost suspiciously into it, though.%K%P
而且这两个人，情绪也很高涨啊…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm grateful for your sentiment, but I'm planning to\nvisit my parents and relax for a while after tomorrow.\d%K%P
「虽然你们担心我让我非常感激，\n但我从明天开始就要回老家啦，也是很悠闲的哦」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dBut you said Gifu doesn't have a sea.\d%K%P
「但是失业的，岐阜可不靠着海啊…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWe have Mount Ontake in exchange. Thanks to it, our\nsummers are relatively cool and pleasant.\d%K%P
「不靠海是没错儿，不过在木曾町还有御岳山呢。\n就算是夏天也很凉快，非常舒服」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dIt's not in Nagano?\d%K%P
「那不是长野的吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dPart of it is in Gifu!\d%K%P
「岐阜也有啊！」\n※译注：御岳山位于长野和岐阜的交界处。%K%P
I bet they didn't teach basic geography in Kantou's\nschools.%K%P
所以说关东的人啊…%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dListen, Laid-off, give up on that boring shit. I mean,\nc'mon, spending Obon with you family? Pfft. Just come with\nme to the sea at Ariake instead!\d%K%P
「我说，失业的，\n还是不要过在盂兰盆节回家这种无聊的人生吧。\n比起这个，跟我一块儿去真真正正的海吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAriake? Can you even swim there?\d%K%P
「在那种地方可以洗海水澡什么的吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI've heard an awesome rumor that all you need to do is\nline up at the right place to make tons of cash over\nthere!\d%K%P
「那可是致富良机啊…\n稍微排一会儿队，军资金就会翻倍，如梦一般的活动啊」\n※译注：Comic Market，许多人会倒卖本子。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI think I'll pass.\d%K%P
「还请容我拒绝」%K%P
...That sounded fishy as hell.%K%P
…那样也太可疑了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dOh, that's right, weren't you returning to Kyushu\ntomorrow, Mr. Retired? Don't you need to start packing?\d%K%P
「这么说起来老爷子明天起要到九州去了是吧？\n现在不去准备也没有关系吗？」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dI'm leaving on the evening train tomorrow. Still, it's\nalmost been a year since I've last seen my old lady.\d%K%P
「我是傍晚的车。\n不过，我和妻子也有一年没见了啊」%K%P
Mr. Retired was planning to visit his wife's grave in\nNagasaki.%K%P
老爷子要去长崎给夫人扫墓。%K%P
According to a rumor, he was greatly respected there, and\neveryone called him \dprofessor,\d but none of us have\nactually seen that with our own eyes, so I couldn't\nexactly comment on the story's credibility.%K%P
有传闻说，那边镇子里的人，\n似乎通常都尊称他为『老师』，\n但谁也没有真正见过，所以也不能说什么。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dIf Osamu is leaving... I guess I should go home too and\nfinally have that fight with my parents.\d%K%P
「理君也要回家探亲了啊…\n我是不是也要回到老家，和家人吵一架呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou should treat your parents well.  ...Not like I'm one\nto talk.\d%K%P
「还是和家人搞好关系为好吧。\n…虽然这话不该由我来说」%K%P
Sunday, August 12th.%K%P
８月１２日 星期日。%K%P
Michihama Commerce had an official summer break for all\nemployees from yesterday to the fifteenth of this month.\nAlthough I went to work both yesterday and today.%K%P
道浜商事从昨天开始到１５日截止，\n进入了为期五天的夏日假期。\n虽说昨天和今天我都有上班就是了。%K%P
In any case, I would use this break to go back home and\nvisit my parents after a long absence. Or at least that's\nwhat I told everyone.%K%P
而我，利用这个连休，\n从明天开始…就要久违地在老家露脸了。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dBut in that case, we're gonna have one lonely Obon in\nhere. Only me, Kuma, and the li'l landlord.\d%K%P
「但是这样的话，盂兰盆节就要变得很寂寞了。\n只有我、小熊和房东小妹了么」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI'm not gonna be in on the fifteenth. We've got an\noffline meetup before the event.\d%K%P
「我也要从１５日起暂时出门了哦。\n在活动前还有线下会」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh? Really? Does that mean Mitoko and Yasunaga will be\nall alone together on the night of the fifteenth?\n...That's not good.\d%K%P
「诶…是这样吗？\n那么１５日晚上只有美都子和八须永君了？\n…真是不妙啊」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhat the hell is that supposed to mean, Laid-off?\d%K%P
「你这是什么意思啊，失业的？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm gonna be fine. Himeo is coming back on the fifteenth,\nso in a worst case scenario I can just stay over at her\nplace.\d%K%P
「没关系。１５号姫绪姐就会回来了。\n一旦有什么情况，要她过来住就好了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...Um, what is that supposed to mean, li'l landlord?\d%K%P
「…你这是什么意思啊，房东妹妹？」%K%P
As far as I knew, Ms. Sawashima had gone to meet a friend\nabroad -- someone from her university years. ...That was\ncertainly on a whole other level compared to a mere trip\nback to your family in Japan.%K%P
泽嶋小姐她好像是去和留学时代的朋友见面了。\n…那个人就算是探亲，档次也和我们不一样啊。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dListen, you guys. I feel like we've got a\nmisunderstanding here, but I'm into older women, all\nright? Truth be told, Laid-off's ex-wife is exactly the\nsort of woman I'm interested in!\d%K%P
「大家听我说一下啊。\n事先说清楚，我基本上只对年长的女性感兴趣喔？\n实际上失业者的前妻是正中我的好球区的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Wait a second.\d%K%P
「…不，请稍微等一下」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dHuh? Then what was that on the first day I moved in?\d%K%P
「啊咧？\n我入住那天，你向我搭话是几个意思啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d......Wait a second.\d%K%P
「……不，请稍微等一下？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI remember how one day he was roughed up by that guy in\nthe sunglasses since he kept pestering the princess before\nwe knew her that well.\d%K%P
「第一次见到隔壁公主大人的时候也是，拼命向她示爱，\n结果就被黑衣男子轰出去了呢」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d.........Yasunaga.\d%K%P
「………八须永君」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dYo, calm down guys. All the girls mentioned here were\neither my age or older, right? I'd never go after the li'l\nlandlord. I mean, I'm not like Laid-off or something.\d%K%P
「所以说，你们放心吧！\n目前我所交往过的女孩，全都是比我大的吧？\n我是不会向房东小妹出手的啦。又不是失业的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI cannot say I am a fan of your phrasing, but can I trust\nyou on that?\d%K%P
「虽然你这话让我非常不能释然…但我可以相信你吗？」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWell, I guess she'd be fine in a few years.\d%K%P
「要是再年长三岁上下的话，她就是绝好球了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMaybe I should stay behind after all.\d%K%P
「我果然还是留下来吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, I can't allow that.\d%K%P
「啊～，那不行」%K%P
Mitoko denied my vague worries about the following three\ndays.%K%P
对我那隐约感到的，那三天后的不安，\n美都子干脆地否定了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou haven't seen your parents in a while, right? You\ngotta spend some time with them sometimes.\d%K%P
「失业先生，你已经很久没有回老家了吧？\n难得尽一次孝，应该比其它任何事都优先吧？」%K%P
She sounded almost like one of those old ladies running a\nboarding house.%K%P
这种说话方式，简直像是出租房的女老板一样。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYour mother is waiting for you, right? You should\ntreasure her more. ...Not sure if I'm in a position to be\ntelling you that, though.\d%K%P
「你的母亲也在老家里吧？\n还是和她好好相处吧。\n…虽然这话不该由我来说」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dMitoko...\d%K%P
「美都子…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
Her situation was far more complicated... and grievous\nthan mine.%K%P
也许没错儿，这个问题对她来说大概有着不同的意义，\n但正因为与别人不同，她的思索也变得更加深刻了。%K%P
As such, I simply couldn't squeeze out the words to argue\nanymore.%K%P
所以既然她这么说了，\n我们也不会说出什么反对的话语。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYeah, thanks, Mitoko. I'll make sure to see that she is\ndoing all right.\d%K%P
「嗯，谢谢，美都子。\n我会好好尽孝心的」%K%P
I was not going back to Gifu either way, but at this\npoint, I had no choice but to follow through with my act.%K%P
就算这是谎言，内心感到非常不安，\n事到如今我也只能将善恶之分抛之脑后。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBe careful on your way back. I hear tap water is not\nalways safe in the countryside.\d%K%P
「回去的时候小心点啊。\n注意不要喝生水哦？」%K%P
