%LC理
\dUm, it's a mountainous place, yes, but our cities aren't\nbuilt on the mountains, if you're worried about that.\d%K%P
「不，御岳山只是单纯的比喻，\n并不是真正要登山…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
