%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's not even a four hour trip by train. You don't need\nto worry about me to that extent!\d%K%P
「坐电车用不了四个小时的。\n你用不着这么担心啦～」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
