Monday, August 13th, 10 AM.%K%P
８月１３日 星期一 上午１０时。%K%P
I was sweating buckets trying to carry the huge bag down\nthe road towards the station.%K%P
我走在去往车站的路上。\n两手拿着的包真的是非常非常重，\n豆大的汗珠从额头上源源不断地冒出。%K%P
In the end, I couldn't bring myself to refuse all the kind\ngestures Mitoko showered me with yesterday.%K%P
昨天晚上被说教之后，\n我最终没有拒绝掉美都子任何一件关心…%K%P
In my bag, she packed medicine for every kind of ailment,\nboxed lunches, little gifts for my parents, and even a\nsweater, since Mitoko was worried that Gifu might be\ncolder than here.%K%P
在包里的，是一套常备药、便当、特产，\n甚至还有她以『岐阜也许会很冷』为由，\n在这个炎夏里塞进来的一件毛衣。%K%P
She refused to listen no matter how hard I tried to\nexplain that my house was built on flat terrain, not the\nmountains.%K%P
不管我说了多少遍我家在平原部分所以没问题，\n她都没有听进去，仍是一副担心的样子。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThis heat is gonna kill me...\d%K%P
「好、好热…」%K%P
Still, it was all the result of her grossly exaggerated\nconcern for my relationship with my parents, and I, in my\nbashfulness, simply couldn't turn down her kind gestures.%K%P
嘛，更不得了的是，她非常担心我和父母的关系，\n对我千叮万嘱，让我都难掩羞愧之情了。%K%P
Nor could I stop sweating buckets.%K%P
但是，顺着脸颊流下来的汗，\n果然还是无法隐藏干净。%K%P
