「帮你拿一半」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
I imagine I made a guilty expression at that moment.%K%P
在那个时候，我一定是露出了些许尴尬的表情吧。%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
