The three days I practically spent living at our old\nworkplace after hearing the shocking but predictable truth\nof our company's demise from the president.%K%P
从社长那里，听到了早已设定好的冲击性事实后，\n仍然住在公司的三天里。%K%P
The three days I spent completely immersed in work, unable\nto quit and never once mustering the courage to face\nMitoko.%K%P
既没有脸见美都子，也不愿意就这么放弃，\n压抑着心里的种种感情，拼命埋头苦干的三天里。%K%P
