I knew that people who knew me would start worrying\nthemselves more than they should if I so much as mentioned\nthat I was having trouble at work.%K%P
就这样，这次的事态，\n让和我相关的人们对这讨厌的符号产生了联想…%K%P
That was why I decided to keep it all to myself.%K%P
正因为他们都是我身边的人，\n有多余的担心也是很正常的，\n所以我更不能说出口。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's true that I'm currently busy with something\nimportant. It's a huge project that might very well decide\nthe fate of the company.\d%K%P
