She still had a complicated expression on her face,\nobviously not convinced by anything I've said.%K%P
她像往常一样脸上带着有些暧昧的表情，\n不过看上去依然是完全不能接受我的做法。%K%P
She stood there and just looked at me, not caring about\ngetting in the way of other people hurrying towards the\ngates.%K%P
但她还是在检票口前站着，\n紧紧地注视着我，\n都快要给其他乘客带来困扰了。%K%P
