%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI don't look like a total shut-in, eh? Check out these\nmuscles! I haven't been training in my room every day for\nnothing!\d%K%P
「家里蹲是不可能拥有这种强韧肉体的吧！\n再怎么说我每天都在房间里拼命锻炼啊」%K%P
