%LC美都子
\dI feel like there's something very wrong with your train\nof thought, but whatever. So, are you leaving today?\d%K%P
「感觉从根本上来说就有什么搞错了吧…算了。\n话说你要从今天开始出门？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYeah, I'll be gone until the end of the week. After two\noffline meetings, I'm gonna line up for one night, and\nthen another, get the tickets, and...\d%K%P
「是啊，一直到周末。\n线下会二连击之后，\n还要通宵再通宵排队领票…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm not sure if you want to be outside tonight, for\nmultiple reasons.\d%K%P
「还是不要通宵了吧。从各种意义上来说」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI'm not sure if we're thinking about the same thing, but\nI'll keep your advice in mind.\d%K%P
「虽然不敢问你离真相到底已经有多近了，\n不过我还是会在心里留意的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'm just worried about your health.\d%K%P
「总之我只是在关心你的健康啊？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dAnyway, I should get a move on before it starts raining.\nSee you in a few days, Mitoko.\d%K%P
「好了，在下雨之前我还是赶紧出门的好。\n差不多该走了，回见」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dLater. And stay safe.\d%K%P
「嗯，路上小心～」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
