%LC科长
\dAh, could you show me the previous page again? The one\nthat had a table of our customers by department? Yes,\nthat's the one.\d%K%P
「啊，回来看一下刚才那一页吧？\n各营业部门的客户一览那里…对，就是这里」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIs something wrong with it?\d%K%P
「察觉到什么了吗？」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dSo our real estate department was dealing with quite a\nfew other places, not just Mitsumaru?\d%K%P
「是在房地产部那里…\n不只是三丸，和其他公司也只有这些成果吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes, all the deals are of a fairly low scale, but I can\nsee an obvious attempt to increase trading partners; in\n2002, we only had one, but it rose to seventeen this\nyear.\d%K%P
「虽然各自的交易额都不多，\n但交易的对象确实存在增加的倾向。\n０２年的时候只有１家公司，去年的话就有１７家了」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dSeventeen? When did that even...?\d%K%P
「１７…什么时候增加的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYes, if you only look at bigger establishments, we have\ndealt with most at least once, besides the Sawashima\nGroup.\d%K%P
「实际上，范围限定在大公司的话，除去泽嶋系列之外，\n基本全都有涉及，处于重重包围之中了」%K%P
%LCChief
%LC科长
\dI didn't notice at all. I wonder if that means we have\nsomeone who has noticed the same thing we did at our real\nestate department.\d%K%P
「真没注意到啊…\n在房地产部里，大概也有人抱有着类似的危机感吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI believe all the projects are kept low-scale so they\nwould fall below the value of needing to report them to\nmanaging directors. It seems most of them have come from\nDivision #3.\d%K%P
